# Nightly machine upkeep (local-maintenance): pending macOS/App Store
# updates, backup freshness, cert expiry, disk space, log rotation, and a
# Sunday docker prune. Findings print an SD_REPORT_ATTENTION line, so the
# run's report reaches Reports and Today; the job exits 0 with findings.
JOB_SCHEDULE="45 3 * * *"
JOB_COMMAND="sh \"$ROOT/../local-maintenance/maintenance.sh\" run"
